{"lines":[{"w":0.81472684191418931,"text":"whole history of man stood under the shadow of world","y":0.9330357145142385,"x":0.068883600450269034,"h":0.021906145981379854,"conf":1},{"y":0.90554408533448405,"text":"destruction and world judgment; and hope, soaring beyond","x":0.06857857228541156,"w":0.81525218022334101,"conf":1,"h":0.026888230490305975},{"h":0.026535276382688489,"text":"this state of affairs, concentrated itself on a renewal of","conf":1,"x":0.068600883848364186,"y":0.88357487159420267,"w":0.81997873876001925},{"x":0.068679609406686659,"text":"earthly life, a new humanity, a new acon. In particular the","conf":1,"y":0.86127938820429628,"w":0.81514992652001306,"h":0.025685334962511797},{"x":0.068883601400387587,"w":0.81472684191418931,"y":0.84300595258864341,"h":0.02036613982821267,"text":"early Church fathers were astonished to see that the Roman","conf":1},{"text":"poet Virgil, of the period of the emperor Augustus, wrote a","y":0.81621627380233897,"conf":1,"w":0.8151022675749543,"x":0.068712382680352388,"h":0.025504912648882105},{"w":0.81472684191418943,"text":"prophetic poem about the One who is to come. In his vision","y":0.79786706308975253,"h":0.020446889930301304,"x":0.068883601774496928,"conf":1},{"h":0.02328081925710046,"text":"the poet thinks he sees that the last age is here and","y":0.77236868916626777,"x":0.06873330898416459,"w":0.72001271433644476,"conf":1},{"w":0.52388639573927054,"text":"\"Time's great Order's born again..•","x":0.16316785230118946,"h":0.028809377125331381,"y":0.73882440807918326,"conf":1},{"text":"If any prints of ancient crimes remain,","x":0.18289787217744441,"y":0.7180059523322817,"w":0.52731590766411318,"h":0.023313492063492092,"conf":1},{"x":0.18289785957337854,"w":0.5914489448844612,"conf":1,"y":0.69766865055162386,"h":0.020354604910290397,"text":"Thou shalt efface them in thy happy reign,"},{"y":0.67584325415194135,"conf":1,"x":0.18052255401619369,"h":0.02037767569224036,"text":"And from perpetual fear all Nations free.\"","w":0.57957245467545149},{"conf":1,"y":0.64825581465173177,"x":0.071258907330780955,"w":0.81235152405577804,"h":0.018906883777133898,"text":"And he thus addresses the divine child who is to usher in"},{"h":0.017168308061266679,"conf":1,"text":"this new age:","x":0.070762837517837088,"y":0.62506373530997883,"w":0.186130090193315},{"text":"\"Go, heavenly race, great progeny of Jove,","conf":1,"y":0.59151785676581348,"h":0.026289682539682557,"w":0.59382421320134948,"x":0.1140142518910119},{"h":0.020423818202245814,"y":0.56969246051548239,"x":0.13301662865397129,"w":0.62707836596996747,"text":"The time draws near thy Honour to improve.","conf":1},{"text":"See how the Pole shakes, with the pond'rous Globe","conf":1,"x":0.13539193128215687,"w":0.69596198936561482,"y":0.54651162821259391,"h":0.021802325097341368},{"h":0.023371170437525124,"conf":1,"y":0.52325581389170472,"text":"Of Earth and Sea, and Heaven's all-spangled Robe;","x":0.13539194050816156,"w":0.71496433406681215},{"y":0.50145348834159087,"w":0.66983369108918422,"h":0.021860003471374512,"x":0.1330166505361679,"conf":1,"text":"How all things at the approaching age rejoice!\" 1"},{"text":"Yes, it may be said with truth: \"With longing hearts have","conf":1,"x":0.10451307764111617,"y":0.47238372122416983,"w":0.77909737128716006,"h":0.021911913440341046},{"text":"the nations waited for Thee.\" In all ages men have suffered","w":0.81279571335037026,"y":0.44869946440160746,"conf":1,"x":0.07104255468927928,"h":0.026243909010811528},{"y":0.42732558182006253,"h":0.020348836505223789,"w":0.80997625573888998,"x":0.073634204983880291,"text":"because of the woes of the world, and always there has","conf":1},{"y":0.40401785744239183,"x":0.068883604488273714,"w":0.81472684191418943,"h":0.021854235066307903,"conf":1,"text":"arisen the hope for a time of salvation which will be ushered"},{"w":0.81710211023107759,"x":0.066508317093487659,"y":0.38219246047914524,"text":"in by a divinely-sent Ruler. A German poet of the igth","conf":1,"h":0.020423818202245814},{"w":0.81472684191418943,"h":0.020452657389262385,"conf":1,"text":"century, Karl Immermann, has given expression to this hope","y":0.3590116282008764,"x":0.068883601774496928},{"h":0.020429585661206895,"text":"in a series of splendid poems. To-day they are almost","conf":1,"y":0.33720930276846373,"x":0.066508332414152271,"w":0.81710211023107759},{"conf":1,"text":"forgotten; but they are worth recalling. The first one begins:","y":0.31395348869890682,"w":0.81947742808948865,"x":0.066508323663094102,"h":0.021860003471374512},{"conf":1,"y":0.28488372135394557,"h":0.021911913440341046,"text":"\"I gaze into our night and lo, beyond","x":0.14726840382408088,"w":0.52256532148881385},{"conf":1,"x":0.16627079497907596,"y":0.26162790703708516,"w":0.64845602852957596,"h":0.021854236012413319,"text":"Our time, a star to guide our children's course!"},{"conf":1,"w":0.60095011723505987,"h":0.020348836505223789,"y":0.23982558168509582,"x":0.16389548340825899,"text":"Star by whose light our duties shall respond"},{"conf":1,"y":0.21947674450901589,"w":0.65558193256328634,"h":0.020354604910290397,"x":0.16389550108177706,"text":"To that true God and Lord who is their source."},{"y":0.19040697700074793,"x":0.14489311355535323,"conf":1,"text":"\"Its rising is not yet. Like ancient woe","h":0.021894610117352165,"w":0.53206649383941262},{"text":"The story of our days, our age's stain,","h":0.023325026981414365,"y":0.16715116315527045,"x":0.16389550001377726,"w":0.5201900036304028,"conf":1},{"y":0.14533730178037041,"conf":1,"w":0.62945368382837863,"text":"Must be effaced, that this new seed may grow","h":0.020360372369251478,"x":0.16389549037288223},{"x":0.1612834503803553,"text":"And yonder king foreshadowed rise and reign.\"","y":0.11951881174030365,"conf":1,"h":0.026003447789994416,"w":0.65377441009917814},{"w":0.39667458967729047,"conf":1,"y":0.095930232330447396,"h":0.015988372621082103,"text":"1 From Eclogue IV; tr. John Ogilby.","x":0.27315914552160808},{"x":0.45130641474645861,"conf":1,"text":"103","w":0.047505936065277476,"h":0.014534883082859107,"y":0.072674418802562757}],"page":99,"w":7029,"h":11508}